Happy Holidays to Our Colleagues In Service,

Louis Fawcett contends that the nonprofit sector is ineffective and is
in need of total transformation.

**RE-IMAGINING NONPROFITS: Turning Your Mess Into a Masterpiece**
inspires charitable executives to deploy free-market principles we know
work in the business sector within nonprofits sector. These changes
produce increased efficiency, effectiveness, and most importantly,
impact. The book also includes practical tools and case studies to
illustrate how these principles can be applied in real-world situations.
Overall,

**RE-IMAGINING NONPROFITS** is a thought-provoking and timely tome that
offers a fresh perspective on how to address society's most pressing
problems. It provides a roadmap for changing the nonprofit sector into a
desperately needed force for good.

"RE-IMAGINING NONPROFITS is taking charity by storm. Louis is leading
the charge to change the way we do business. Fawcett takes an 'emperor
has no clothes' approach to the piety and crazymaking rampant throughout
our charity. It's a page-turner that will have you saying to yourself,
